# =======================================================================
# Ashish Singh Portfolio - Contact Form & Environment Configuration
# =======================================================================
# The website works immediately out-of-the-box as a static application.
# By default, the contact form is wired to deliver messages directly to
# ashishsingh2b@gmail.com via Formspree.

# OPTION 1: Formspree (Recommended, zero extra dependencies)
# 1. Sign up at https://formspree.io/
# 2. Create a new form pointing to ashishsingh2b@gmail.com
# 3. Copy your Form ID (e.g. "mqkvygqk" or "xpwzbklm") and paste below:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=mqkvygqk

# Alternatively, specify the full Formspree endpoint URL:
# VITE_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=https://formspree.io/f/mqkvygqk

# OPTION 2: EmailJS (Alternative provider)
# 1. Sign up at https://www.emailjs.com/
# 2. Create an Email Service connected to ashishsingh2b@gmail.com
# 3. Create an Email Template with parameters: {{from_name}}, {{from_email}}, {{subject}}, {{message}}
# 4. Fill in your service details below:
# VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=your_emailjs_service_id
# VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=your_emailjs_template_id
# VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=your_emailjs_public_key
